**Files changed:** `src/new_grep/new_grep.c`

**Behavior added:** `-i` / `--ignore-case` flag for case-insensitive matching using ASCII-only folding.

**Folding rule:** Bytes `0x41`–`0x5A` (`A`–`Z`) fold to `0x61`–`0x7A` (`a`–`z`) via `c | 0x20`; all other bytes pass through unchanged. Applied once to pattern, then compared byte-by-byte with folded input lines.

